**Deciding Badge & UI Elements**

I'm now focusing on optimizing the UI of the bestseller badge. I've realized the existing border and shadow provide sufficient visual distinction. The top gradient line seems redundant and creates clutter with the badge, so I've removed it. The badge is positioned in the top-right, and I'm ensuring it integrates well with the overall design. I am also investigating the meaning of the word "über" in relation to grid elements.


**Resolving Card Alignment**

I'm currently trying to resolve alignment issues caused by the "Bestseller" badge.  It's impacting the grid layout, so I'm deciding between shifting all cards or adjusting the middle card's vertical position. The badge's appearance is fine; the integration and the layout are my focus now.

